%% v1.1 增量时序图（源文件，配套 docs/07-增量设计与任务列表-v1.1.md §7）
%% 场景：一次「首轮未过 → 定向修复 1 轮 → 通过 → 终局审批 → completed」全链路
%% v1.0 全量时序图见 docs/sequence-diagram.mermaid（未覆盖）
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CLI as scripts/run_benchmark.py
    participant ENG as OrchestrationEngine
    participant EXE as RoleStageExecutor
    participant GATE as HarnessEvaluationGate
    participant HAR as EvaluationHarness
    participant RC as RepairController
    participant MSG as MessagePublisher
    participant HITL as ApprovalEngine
    participant DB as SQLite (runs/events/messages/artifacts)

    CLI->>DB: ProjectRepository.create(bench-…) + RunRepository.create(mode=batch, context.benchmark)
    CLI->>ENG: launch(run_id)
    ENG->>EXE: execute(prd) → execute(architecture) → execute(coding, attempt=1)
    EXE->>DB: ArtifactStore.save(code, v1) + artifact.created
    ENG->>ENG: _advance(on="stage_completed") → evaluation
    Note over EXE: QA(LLM) 只出叙事报告，不参与通过判定
    ENG->>EXE: execute(evaluation, attempt=1)
    EXE->>DB: save(evaluation_report, v1)
    Note over ENG: 阶段产物完成 → 进入确定性裁决分叉
    ENG->>GATE: evaluate(run, evaluation_stage, attempt)
    GATE->>HAR: evaluate_task(task{project_id, run_id, checks=该任务 checks})
    HAR-->>GATE: TaskOut{total=62.4, runnability=48.0, passed=false, failed_checks=[pytest]}
    GATE->>DB: save(eval_verdict, v1)（run_id / artifact_version=1 / verdict_source=harness）
    GATE-->>ENG: EvalVerdict{status=fail, failed_checks=[…]}
    ENG->>RC: record_verdict() → context.repair.history += {round:0, fail}
    ENG-->>DB: event evaluation.failed{repair_round:0, max_rounds:2}
    ENG->>RC: decide() → "repair"
    RC->>DB: context.repair.round=1（整体赋值 patch）
    RC->>DB: 作废 coding/completed + evaluation/completed → failed（复用补推进机制）
    RC->>MSG: publish(feedback, to_role=engineer, payload.source=auto_repair, failed_checks, previous=v1)
    ENG-->>DB: event repair.started{repair_round:1, target_stage:coding, artifact_version:1}
    ENG->>ENG: _advance(on="evaluation_failed") → coding
    ENG->>HITL: on_stage_completed(run, coding, ApprovalContext(phase=stage_completed, repair_active=true))
    HITL-->>DB: event approval.deferred{stage_id:coding, repair_round:1}（不建卡片）
    ENG->>EXE: execute(coding, attempt=2)
    EXE->>DB: 读最新 auto_repair feedback + code v1 → StageInput.repair_context / previous_output
    EXE->>DB: save(code, v2, parent=v1) + artifact.created
    ENG->>ENG: _advance(on="stage_completed") → evaluation
    ENG->>GATE: evaluate(run, evaluation_stage, attempt=2)
    GATE->>HAR: evaluate_task(...) → total=81.3, runnability=80.0, passed=true
    HAR-->>GATE: TaskOut{passed=true}
    GATE-->>ENG: EvalVerdict{status=pass, artifact_version=2}
    ENG->>RC: record_verdict() → history += {round:1, pass}
    ENG-->>DB: event evaluation.completed{passed:true, total:81.3}
    Note over ENG: next_stage(on="stage_completed") == __end__ → 终局裁决前审批
    ENG->>HITL: on_stage_completed(run, coding, ApprovalContext(phase=final_candidate, is_final=true, repair_round=1))
    HITL->>DB: 建 1 张 pending Approval{stage_id:coding, artifact_refs=[code v2]}
    HITL-->>DB: event approval.requested
    ENG->>DB: run.status = waiting_approval
    Note over HITL: 人工 approve（POST /approvals/{id}/decision）
    HITL->>ENG: request_resume(run_id)
    ENG->>ENG: _advance → __end__ → run.completed
    ENG-->>DB: event run.completed
    CLI->>DB: 读 context.repair.history + sum(model_calls.cost_cny) + (finished_at-started_at)
    CLI->>CLI: BaselineRow(first=62.4/❌, final=81.3/✅, rounds=1, cost=实测, wall=…)
    CLI->>CLI: 写 data/benchmark/state-*.json（原子 replace）+ baseline-*.md/.json
